// # scripts/ — Retired Runners Index
//
// Logline: Records that .oo build/test/verify/release runners were
//          removed in favor of GitHub workflows.
//
// Setup: RFC-0005 §4. No .oo files ship in this directory. The
//        entry points live in .github/workflows/ (gh-owned).
//        This file remains so the directory keeps a front door.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Build, test, verify, release run in .github/workflows/ci.yml.
//   2. qa/ holds test code. Push to main is the release (RFC-0006).
//   3. Do not re-add .oo runners here.
